*** Keywords ***
General_SiSo_Auto_RMOD_Power_Consumption
    [Documentation]  
    ...  The test measures power consumption on the RMOD(s) over a specified time period (with measurements taken every 60 seconds) and verifies
    ...  whether any of the measurements exceed the maximum threshold provided by the user.
    ...
    ...  :param dict rmod_ids_with_power_consumption: (Mandatory): Configured RMOD id(s) with maximum power consumption threshold in Watts.
    ...                                                            e.g. {1: 360, 2: 560}
    ...  :param str duration: (Optional): Duration of the measurement in minutes. Default is 15 min.

    [Arguments]      ${rmod_ids_with_max_power_consumption}
    ...              ${duration}=15

    ${bts_type}                                         hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}                                       connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                 bts_type=${bts_type}

    ${power_consumption_measurements}=                  Measure RMOD Power Consumption
    ...                                                 rmod_ids=${rmod_ids_with_max_power_consumption.keys()}
    ...                                                 duration=${duration}
    Robot Log Result                                    RMODs power consumption measurements: ${power_consumption_measurements}
    Verify RMOD Power Consumption                       rmod_ids_with_max_power_consumption=${rmod_ids_with_max_power_consumption}
    ...                                                 power_measurements=${power_consumption_measurements}
    ...                                                 connection=${connection}
